  "info": {
    "description": "\n**V1 has no authentication. Local/private use only \u2014 do not expose to the public internet.**\n\nOutputs of this platform are prospectivity/anomaly layers, never confirmation of gold, caves or voids.\nPhase 1 exposes only health checks and a `noop` job; no scientific results exist yet.\n",
    "title": "geo-prospecting-platform API",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
